L[20]='''index-lifecycle/1 pins document/schema/restore/generation cursor. IndexBatch max100 documents/1MiB, canonical payload hash. IndexSubmission status submitted/committed/unknown/failed; accepted asynchronous task is not applied proof. IndexOutcome pending/committed/failed/unknown; missing task after timeout remains unknown. One scoped SQL generation lane serializes delta/rebuild/swap; unknown quarantines the lane and fresh writes, never takes over a possibly alive sender. Dirty/outbox sourceRevision and checkpoint track a contiguous proved terminal gap-aware commit watermark, never ID allocation order. Rebuild captures an immutable source snapshot, catches gaps, fences every delta task until terminal, swaps the exact marker and verifies postcondition before selection CAS. Lost swap remains unknown; no blind inverse swap. Restore rejects old cursor/epoch. Qualified external SDK source/ABI/lock/ref/suite is P6.1/P6.7 obligation, no SDK adopted here; PG base query remains independent.'''
L[22]='''recurrence/1 DTSTART is tagged DATE/TZID/UTC. DATE has a half-open date window; timed values use a UTC instant window after civil resolution, never midnight conversion. Final DateWindow/InstantWindow helpers convert by composition into RecurrenceWindow, not incompatible final subclasses. One RRULE and finite RDATE/EXDATE/overrides. EXRULE, multiple RRULE, custom VTIMEZONE, floating time, RANGE=THISANDFUTURE and leap second60 are unsupportedFeature. Defaults: range366days/emitted1000/candidateSteps100000/wall2s/memory32MiB/rule8192bytes/exceptions10000. Library source must qualify COUNT before query window, invalid civil times, DST gap/fold choice, moved override original identity and required BY combinations. Key is SHA256 length-prefixed seriesID/immutableRevision/valueType/original nominal/original TZID; no UTC/name/provider identity. Actual tzdbVersion required; unavailable pin is environmentMismatch. Cursor binds set/window/tzdb/library hashes; stale cursor refuses. OccurrencePage status complete/limited/invalid/unsupported; limited requires nextCursor, completeThrough only contiguous scanned prefix. No selected upstream source or new dependency here: P7.1 records exact immutable licensed ref/ABI/upstream suite before wrapper adoption, no handwritten RRULE engine.'''
